==Glossy Cupid Wings==
The '''Cupid Wings''' were initially released in Jam Mart Clothing on February 6, 2014, and left sometime in 2014. On this initial release they had a "glossy" white shine, except for the black variety with a light gray shine. These varieties came to be known as the "glossy Cupid Wings," or "glossies," by the Animal Jam Community. There is no white variety of the Glossy Cupid Wings.
